.venv_dashboard/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.streamlit/*
# config.toml holds no secrets (just server settings, e.g. enableStaticServing for the
# v4.6 WebAuthn registration popup relay) and needs to actually deploy with the app --
# everything else in .streamlit/ (secrets.toml, the secrets.*.toml.bak backups) stays
# ignored.
!.streamlit/config.toml
*.log
* - bk.xlsx
labs/
scripts/full_history_check.json
data/backups/
